        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “settlement” the following definition: “ Shariah Advisory Council” means Shariah Advisory Council established under section 316a;”; and (b) by inserting after the definition of “Islamic bank” the following definition: ‘ “Islamic capital market business or transaction” means—"
      }
